{"id":102361710,"slug":"magic-unicorn-therapist-referral","title":"Magic Unicorn Therapist Referral, In Network Only","subtitle":"Only slightly satirical…","post_date":"2023-10-06T12:56:47.591Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/magic-unicorn-therapist-referral","wordcount":348,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:56:50.999Z","body_sha256":"9644aec5d5d17e089e4ec4fcbb12bca137bb6a8ac8584b4acfb112fa1f59d046","text_words":345,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>I am a mental health professional, so I have been on many list-serves.  A lot of referrals are requested, and some of them are not likely to be filled. Those requests inspire the following piece of satire.  We were promised matching platforms!  So many companies have offered to match a patient with a therapist…and yet, the match proves elusive.</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><div class=\"pullquote\"><p>The images are just copying and pasting the text above into an AI image generator.  I took the first thing it generated in all cases.</p></div><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZBjt!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8c916db1-08a0-487b-8e22-7e060a7412c3_739x474.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZBjt!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8c916db1-08a0-487b-8e22-7e060a7412c3_739x474.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZBjt!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8c916db1-08a0-487b-8e22-7e060a7412c3_739x474.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZBjt!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8c916db1-08a0-487b-8e22-7e060a7412c3_739x474.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZBjt!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8c916db1-08a0-487b-8e22-7e060a7412c3_739x474.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZBjt!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8c916db1-08a0-487b-8e22-7e060a7412c3_739x474.jpeg\" width=\"739\" height=\"474\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/8c916db1-08a0-487b-8e22-7e060a7412c3_739x474.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:474,&quot;width&quot;:739,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:63654,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZBjt!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8c916db1-08a0-487b-8e22-7e060a7412c3_739x474.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZBjt!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8c916db1-08a0-487b-8e22-7e060a7412c3_739x474.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZBjt!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8c916db1-08a0-487b-8e22-7e060a7412c3_739x474.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZBjt!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8c916db1-08a0-487b-8e22-7e060a7412c3_739x474.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><h2><strong>Monday:</strong></h2><p>“I have someone who reached out looking for in-person therapy.&nbsp; The person would like to work on \"nothing much.\"&nbsp; The therapist must network with the Insurance Community Plan but be willing to submit bills while the client travels worldwide because of their digital nomad lifestyle.  Vast Experience preferred and conducting&nbsp;sessions in-person (no virtual sessions).&nbsp; In network ONLY”</p><h3><strong>Tuesday:</strong></h3><p>“A male client reached out looking for a male therapist with lived experience as a professional athlete.  Must feel comfortable with fees paid with lottery tickets.  DBT Trained, but not into as a modality.”</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2E1t!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34a90995-1f5c-4208-9474-e9f7c97f2296_3072x2048.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2E1t!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34a90995-1f5c-4208-9474-e9f7c97f2296_3072x2048.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2E1t!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34a90995-1f5c-4208-9474-e9f7c97f2296_3072x2048.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2E1t!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34a90995-1f5c-4208-9474-e9f7c97f2296_3072x2048.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s